  "solution": "Given equation: 2 * 16 * 11 * 12 * 4 * 355\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1, ×, +, +, ÷, =\n\nGiven : 2 * 16 * 11 * 12 * 4 * 355\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 2 × 16 + 11 + __**12 ÷ 4**__ = 355,\n\n⇒ __**2 × **____**16**__ + 11 + 3 = 355,\n\n⇒ __**32 + 11 **____**+ 3 **__= 355,\n\n⇒ 46 ≠ 355,\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2, ×, ×, +, ÷, =**\n\nGiven : 2 * 16 * 11 * 12 * 4 * 355\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 2 × 16 × 11 + __**12 ÷ 4**__ = 355,\n\n⇒ **__2 × 16 × 11__**__** **__+ 3 = 355,\n\n⇒ **__352 + 3__** = 355,\n\n⇒ 355 = 355\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS **\n\nOption 3, −, ×, +, ÷, =\n\nGiven : 2 * 16 * 11 * 12 * 4 * 355\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 2 − 16 × 11 + __**12 ÷ 4**__ = 355,\n\n⇒ 2 − __**16 ×**____** 11**__ + 3 = 355, \n\n⇒ __**2 **__− 176 __**+ 3**__ = 355, \n\n⇒ __**5 - 176**__ = 355,\n\n⇒ - 171 ≠ 355,\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4, ×, −, +, ÷, =\n\nGiven : 2 * 16 * 11 * 12 * 4 * 355\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 2 × 16 − 11 + __**12 ÷ 4**__ = 355,\n\n⇒ __**2 **____**× 1**____**6**__ − 11 + 3 = 355,\n\n⇒ 32 − __**11 + 3**__ = 355,\n\n⇒ __**32 - 14**__ = 355,\n\n⇒ 18 ≠ 355,\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
